% Empty datamodel extension for the alphabetic biblatex style. biblatex
% probes for <style>.dbx and logs "file 'alphabetic.dbx' not found" without
% it, which arXiv's AutoTeX scanner treats as a missing file. The standard
% data model applies unchanged.
\ProvidesFile{alphabetic.dbx}[2026/09/20 empty datamodel stub for arXiv]
